{{Term/Store|Opal Earrings|Opal Earrings|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Opal Earrings are a type of [[Accessory]], being [[Earring]]s that can be clipped onto [[Link]]'s ears.<ref name="CaC 196"/> They can be purchased at the [[Starlight Memories]] [[Jewelry Shop]] in [[Gerudo Town]] for 200 [[Rupee]]s and eight [[Opal]]s.<ref name="BotW Isha"/> When worn, they provide one level of [[Swim Speed Up]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

Opal Earrings can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. However, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

