==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Opal Earrings are a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and they are obtained by completing the [[Quest]] "[[The Hope of Central Hyrule]]". Unlike most other pieces of Attire, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].
